---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the editor behind Software Rewired.">
  <section class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-panel reveal">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <div class="about-hero">
          <div class="about-headline">
            <div class="about-photo">
              <img src="/about-portrait.svg" alt="Portrait illustration" loading="lazy" width="160" height="160" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">About Me</p>
              <h1>Hi, I’m Anurag Mohan.</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="lead">
              Software Rewired is about how modern technologies — especially AI —
              are reshaping software and the way we build, operate, and experience it.
            </p>
            <div class="about-tags">
              <span class="tag">AI-First Software</span>
              <span class="tag">Cloud Architecture</span>
              <span class="tag">Platform Strategy</span>
              <span class="tag">Systems Design</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>What I Focus On</h2>
        <p>
          My focus is how software gets rewired by the technologies shaping the next
          era — especially AI-first approaches that change the software stack, the
          architecture patterns we rely on, and the influence software has on people.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started as a Windows developer, moved into web programming, and then
          deepened into DevOps, cloud architecture, containers, Kubernetes, and AI.
          I’ve worked across AWS, Azure, and OCI, and I’ve partnered with tens of
          customers while reviewing hundreds of architecture patterns.
        </p>

        <h3>What You’ll Find Here</h3>
        <ul class="about-list">
          <li>How AI changes software architecture — not just features.</li>
          <li>Patterns for reliability, cost control, and scale.</li>
          <li>Strategy for preparing teams and platforms for the AI wave.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Why I Write</h3>
        <p>
          The goal is to make the next generation of software more intentional. I’ll
          share the patterns that worked, the ones that broke, and the decisions that
          matter when you’re rewiring a stack for AI.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
